OL,3,GNEWSASoup-maker sees business soar
OL,4,Aafter Dragons' Den
OL,5,
OL,6,FA soup-maker has said she has seen a
OL,7,Fmassive surge in demand since appearing
OL,8,Fon tv series Dragons' Den.
OL,10,FBella Acland, from Shropshire, won the
OL,11,Fbacking of guest dragon Susie Ma and
OL,12,F#40,000 on the BBC show, which aired on
OL,13,FThursday. She said the firm had been
OL,14,F"prepared for a spike [in sales], but
OL,15,Fnothing like this".
OL,17,FSince filming the episode, Soul Kitchen
OL,18,Fhas seen sales grow by 920%, with
OL,19,Falmost 500,000 soups sold and has been
OL,20,Fable to expand into more than 100
OL,21,Findependent stockists.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
